<p id="mwew">27 potential contestants were revealed on September 16, 2024.<sup about="#mwt58" class="mw-ref reference" id="cite_ref-17" rel="dc:references" typeof="mw:Extension/ref" data-mw='{"name":"ref","attrs":{},"body":{"id":"mw-reference-text-cite_note-17"}}'><a href="#cite_note-17" id="mwfA"><span class="mw-reflink-text" id="mwfQ"><span class="cite-bracket" id="mwfg">[</span>17<span class="cite-bracket" id="mwfw">]</span></span></a></sup></p>

